    ^^^^^^^
An Int has `abs`, `clamp`, `between?`, `zero?`, `positive?`, `negative?`, `even?`, `odd?`, `multiple_of?`, `digits`, `gcd`, `lcm`, `factorial`, `to_float`, and `to_string`.
